.TH UOS-AI-LIBRE 1 "November 2026" "uos-ai-libre 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
uos-ai-libre \- native aish-based UOS AI-compatible desktop assistant
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B uos-ai-libre
[\fB\-\-chat\fR]
.br
.B uos-ai-libre
\fB\-\-service\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B uos-ai-libre
is a Qt Quick frontend for the aish agent engine.  It implements the
\fBcom.deepin.copilot\fR and \fBcom.iflytek.aiassistant\fR D-Bus interfaces used
by DDE components and provides a chat window, a floating Quick AI panel, and
the Super+Space shortcut.
.PP
Models, providers, permissions, tools, sessions, MCP servers and skills remain
owned by the aish backend; the QML layer does not reimplement them.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-chat
Show the chat window.  If an instance is already running, ask that instance to
show the window instead of starting a second backend.
.TP
.B \-\-service
Run without opening the main window and own the compatibility D-Bus names.
This is the mode used by the D-Bus activation files and the XDG autostart
entry.
.TP
.B \-\-dde-service
Alias for \fB\-\-service\fR.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B AISH_CONFIG_DIR
Directory containing the aish configuration.  Defaults to the backend's
standard per-user configuration location.
.TP
.B UOS_AI_LIBRE_THEME
Set to \fBlight\fR or \fBdark\fR to override the detected theme.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/xdg/autostart/uos-ai-libre-service.desktop
Starts the D-Bus compatibility service at login.
.TP
.I /usr/share/dbus-1/services/com.deepin.copilot.service
D-Bus activation entry for the copilot interface.
.TP
.I /usr/share/dbus-1/services/com.iflytek.aiassistant.service
D-Bus activation entry for the iFlytek-compatible interface.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR dbus-daemon (1),
.BR systemd (1)
.PP
The upstream project is at https://github.com/AI-Shell-Team/aish.
